OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers 'no longer required to
OL,4,Asweat it out'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir conditioning will be fitted in some
OL,7,FLondon buses in what the Unite union
OL,8,Fdescribed as a "ground-breaking
OL,9,Fvictory" for drivers for Arriva London
OL,10,FNorth.
OL,12,FDrivers based at Barking, Edmonton,
OL,13,FEnfield, Grays, Palmers Green, Stamford
OL,14,FHill, Tottenham and Wood Green took
OL,15,Findustrial action last month over hot
OL,16,Fweather working conditions.
OL,18,FUnite general secretary Sharon Graham
OL,19,Fsaid the deal meant "drivers will no
OL,20,Flonger be expected to carry on and
OL,21,Fsweat it out".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
